{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[martingal]]

===Etymology===
{{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|martingale|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A piece of [[harness]] used on a [[horse]] to keep it from raising its head above a desired point.
# {{context|nautical|lang=en}} A [[spar]], or piece of [[rigging]] that [[strengthen]]s the [[bowsprit]].
# {{context|mathematics|lang=en}} A [[stochastic]] [[process]] relating [[random]] variables to earlier values
# A [[gambling]] [[strategy]] in which one [[double]]s the [[stake]] after each [[loss]].
# {{context|fencing|lang=en}} A [[strap]] attached to the sword handle, preventing a sword being dropped if [[disarmed]].

